        "ru": "Четыре варианта круиза по Босфору: с завтраком, обедом или лёгкими угощениями."
      },
      "fullDescription": {
        "en": "Choose a morning, afternoon, sunset or moonlight cruise. Listed prices and times are taken from the supplied operator brochure and are subject to reconfirmation.",
